{"response":{"docs":[{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03460755","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03460755","description":["A malt that is from wheat grain (Triticum aestivum)."],"label":"wheat malt","obo_id":"FOODON:03460755","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03304536","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03304536","description":["SIREN DB annotation:\n* finely ground FOODON:03430106\n* not heat-treated FOODON:03440003\n* dry mix FOODON:03530090\n* germinated or sprouted seed FOODON:03420102\n* water removal process FOODON:03460138\n* enzymatic modification process FOODON:03460252\n* preservation by dehydration or drying FOODON:03470116"],"label":"malted wheat flour mix","obo_id":"FOODON:03304536","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03306061","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03306061","description":["SIREN DB annotation:\n* medium ground FOODON:03430117\n* not heat-treated FOODON:03440003\n* germinated or sprouted seed FOODON:03420102\n* water removal process FOODON:03460138\n* enzymatic modification process FOODON:03460252\n* preservation by dehydration or drying FOODON:03470116"],"label":"malted wheat (coarse ground)","obo_id":"FOODON:03306061","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03302677","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03302677","description":["SIREN DB annotation:\n* medium ground FOODON:03430117\n* fully heat-treated FOODON:03440014\n* seed, skin removed, germ removed (endosperm) FOODON:03420208\n* water removal process FOODON:03460138\n* instantizing process FOODON:03460169\n* flavoring added, artificial FOODON:03460228\n* preservation by dehydration or drying FOODON:03470116\n* ingredient: wheat germ added FOODON:03460222"],"label":"cream of wheat (artificially caramel malt-flavored, dry, instant)","obo_id":"FOODON:03302677","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03543331","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03543331","description":["The category covers any type of Beer and beer-like beverage. Beer is an alcoholic beverage produced by the saccharification of starch and fermentation of the resulting sugar. The starch and saccharification enzymes are often derived from malted cereal grains, most commonly malted barley and malted wheat. Most beer is also flavoured with hops, which add bitterness and act as a natural preservative, though other flavourings such as herbs or fruit may occasionally be included. The preparation of beer is called brewing. Alcohol-free beers and beverages similar to beer are also included in this group. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole marketed unit or a homogeneous representative portion.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beer] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm\u003disch\u0026q\u003dBeer and beer-like beverage]"],"label":"33310 - beer and beer-like beverage (efsa foodex2)","obo_id":"FOODON:03543331","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03306510","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03306510","description":["SIREN DB annotation:\n* finely ground FOODON:03430106\n* fully heat-treated FOODON:03440014\n* seed, skin removed, germ removed (endosperm) FOODON:03420208\n* water removal process FOODON:03460138\n* preservation by dehydration or drying FOODON:03470116\n* ingredient: flavoring or spice extract or concentrate added FOODON:03460100","Malted milk is a powdered gruel made from a mixture of malted barley, wheat flour, and evaporated whole milk."],"label":"malted cow milk (powdered)","obo_id":"FOODON:03306510","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00001260","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_00001260","description":["Beer is a fermented cereal beverage resulting from the fermentation most commonly of malted barley (though wheat, corn, or rice may included), by a yeast, most commonly Saccharomyces cerevisiae, and flavored by dried flowers of hops, Humulus lupulus."],"label":"beer beverage","obo_id":"FOODON:00001260","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03543384","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03543384","description":["The group includes any type of Spirits obtained by distilling fermented grain mash, including barley, rye, malted rye and malted barley, corn and wheat. Whiskey and Bourbon whiskey are included in this group. The part consumed/analysed is by default the whole or a portion of it representing the observed heterogeneity. ] and [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whisky] and [https://www.google.co.uk/search?tbm\u003disch\u0026q\u003dWhisky]"],"label":"33840 - whisky (efsa foodex2)","obo_id":"FOODON:03543384","type":"class"},{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03302651","ontology_name":"foodon","ontology_prefix":"FOODON","short_form":"FOODON_03302651","description":["SIREN DB annotation:\n* whole, shape achieved by forming, thickness \u003c0.3 cm. FOODON:03430153\n* fully heat-treated FOODON:03440014\n* seed, skin present, germ present FOODON:03420133\n* ingredient: maltose CHEBI:17306\n* ingredient: fat or oil added FOODON:03460221"],"label":"whole wheat cracker","obo_id":"FOODON:03302651","type":"class"}],"numFound":9,"start":0},"responseHeader":{"QTime":0,"status":0},"facet_counts":{"facet_fields":{"ontologyPreferredPrefix":["FOODON","9"],"isDefiningOntology":["true","9"],"ontologyId":["foodon","9","tfo","4","ecto","1","enm","1","envo","1","maxo","1"],"ontologyIri":["http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/foodon.owl","9"],"isObsolete":["false","9"],"type":["class","9"]}}}